\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0   Good teacher, you have all wisdom
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0   than all teachers of this earth
\par  The father's own Son whom you are
\par   knows much more than the servant.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  You taught us about heavenly things
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0   as one who comes from above
\par  Where you formerly were living
\par  No one knows there except you.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.   God's own plans and all intentions
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0  You taught us and fulfilled too
\par   In you the heavenly kingdom
\par  is almost revealed on earth.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  4.  Forgiveness of sins is with you
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 You the father's loving Son
\par  God became our father through you
\par and we became God's children.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par   5.   He who believes and receives your
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 flesh as bread and blood as wine
\par eats and drinks as his food on earth
\par will receive eternal life.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  6.   Good teacher let me see the way
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 that which leads me to safety
\par Let me be a learner of you
\par \pard      and make me as wise as you.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

